# Champions of Abyssea (abyssea 171), the maw list: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with the quest accepted, its story
# quests before it and the three set quests completed (GMs: their offers would tie with 342). The section counts the
# nine maw quests of its list (1 A Goldstruck Gigas, 2 To Paste a Peiste, 3 Megadrile Menace, 4 The Beast of Bastore, 5
# A Delectable Demon, 6 A Fluttery Fiend, 7 A Beaked Blusterer, 8 A Man-eating Mite, 9 An Ulcerous Uragnite) and wants
# 7. Joachim with 6 of them completed (GMs), in 4 sets {2,4,6,7,8,9} {1,3,5,7,8,9} {2,3,4,5,6,8} {1,3,5,6,7,9}: no
# section each time: his script's 328. Each list entry n has a set holding n + 1 but not n (the last: one without 9; A
# Journey Begins, completed, stands after it), so an entry read as the next quest would count 7 there. Then 2 completed
# too: 7: 342, finished: completed, A Sea Dog's Summons accepted.
